{
  "items": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "The app keeps crashing every time I try to switch to offline mode. I've lost hours of music and my patience. Unacceptable for a paid service."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "I like the music, but the ads on the free tier are too intrusive. I keep getting interrupted during my favorite songs, which ruins the experience."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Spotify is the only app I trust for music. The recommendations are spot on, the catalog is huge, and the family plan is a great value for our household."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "It's a solid app, but I wish the UI was a bit cleaner. Sometimes it's hard to find specific playlists, and the search function could be faster."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "Absolutely love the new podcast integration. I can now listen to my favorite shows and music in one place. The seamless transition between audio types is brilliant."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "Good music library, but the price hike was a bit much. I'm considering switching to Apple Music just to see if the difference is worth it."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "Terrible customer support. I tried to cancel my subscription and was stuck in a loop for 20 minutes. No human help available. Very frustrating."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "I enjoy the shuffle feature, but it sometimes skips songs I actually like. The algorithm needs to be smarter about my preferences."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "The audio quality on the premium tier is excellent. I use it with my high-end headphones and the sound is crisp and clear. Highly recommended."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "It's okay, but I miss the old interface. The new design feels cluttered, and I can't find my favorite playlists as easily as before."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "The app is constantly updating and breaking things. Last week, my entire library disappeared for a day. I can't rely on it anymore."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "I like the music, but the lack of lyrics is a big downside. I have to switch to another app just to see what's being sung."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "Spotify is my go-to for everything. The daily mixes are incredibly accurate, and the app is stable and fast. I can't imagine life without it."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "Great for discovering new artists. The 'Radar' feature is a game-changer for keeping up with my favorite bands. The app is intuitive and easy to use."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "The student discount is a nice touch, but the app still lags on my older phone. It's not as smooth as it should be for a premium service."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "I'm on the fence. The music is great, but the price is high. I'm looking into other options to see if I can save some money."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "The car integration is poor. Bluetooth keeps disconnecting, and the voice control is unreliable. I have to use my phone manually every time."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "I was charged twice for my subscription and customer support ignored my emails. I'm cancelling immediately. This is a scam."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "The family plan is a steal. Everyone in the house has their own profile, and the recommendations are personalized. It's the best value in the market."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "I like the music, but the ads are too frequent. It feels like I'm being punished for not paying more. I'm considering downgrading to a free tier."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "text": "The app is reliable and the music library is extensive. I appreciate the ability to download songs for offline listening. It's a solid choice."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "text": "Good app, but I wish there was more control over the shuffle. Sometimes it plays songs I don't like, and I have to skip through them."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "text": "The price is too high for what you get. I'm looking into other services that offer similar features for less money. It's a tough call."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "text": "Spotify is the best. The recommendations are always on point, and the app is easy to use. I love the new features they've added recently."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "text": "The app is slow and often freezes. I've tried restarting my phone, but the issue persists. It's becoming a hassle to use."
    }
  ]
}
